WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.674
Kusheh en welkom to H R officer training for SaloneHCM.

2
00:00:03.674 --> 00:00:10.583
Na yu work de keep every record correct — en correct record na wetin de mek payroll, compliance, en audit easy.

3
00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:15.874
Wi go cover di employee register, leave management, attendance, en di document vault.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:19.364
Di employee register na yu single source of truth.

5
00:00:19.364 --> 00:00:24.658
Every person in grade, salary, bank details, NASSIT number, en department de live ya.

6
00:00:24.658 --> 00:00:35.930
Use di search bar for find anybody one time, en di add employee button for onboard new person — di form go guide yu through every required field, including statutory identifier dem.

7
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:44.724
Next one, leave. Workman den de request leave from den self-service portal, en di request dem de come ya for yu approval.

8
00:00:44.724 --> 00:00:51.890
Yu able see balance, date dem wey de overlap, en di team calendar before yu decide — so cover gap no go surprise yu.

9
00:00:53.250 --> 00:01:00.486
Attendance de gi yu di daily picture: who clock in, who no come, en di timesheet total dem wey de feed into payroll.

10
00:01:00.486 --> 00:01:05.226
H R able correct record when device fail — en every correction de audit log.

11
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:17.169
Last one, di document vault. Contract dem, identity document dem, disciplinary letter dem — upload one time, store safe na di cloud, en scope to yu organisation.

12
00:01:17.169 --> 00:01:21.050
Use di search en category filter for find anything quick quick.

13
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:26.535
Memba: clean employee data today de prevent payroll palava tomorrow.

14
00:01:26.535 --> 00:01:32.018
When yu ready, go take di H R officer quiz na di Training Center en get yu certificate.
